    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch03-17: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.80";
    dc:description "The systems are precisely executable and bounded rule spaces can be enumerated with standard software. Existing computation can demonstrate many examples, but cannot establish unrestricted randomness or a rule-independent frequency without additional conventions.";
