    dc:type "resolution-route/computation";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Enumerate bounded rewrite expressions and seeds, iterate each for a fixed horizon, and classify stabilization, periodicity, growth, compressibility, and statistical irregularity. Reproducible non-stabilizing, low-compressibility cases confirm existence, while frequencies quantify the word often.";
